Changes from 0.14.6 to 0.14.7 - released 2026/10/22

* Renamed

- the Composer package is `se7enxweb/ggwebservices`. Before 0.14.7 it was published as `gggeek/ggwebservices`, the
  name of the original package, which Packagist builds from the original author's repository, so the maintained
  releases could not be installed under it. composer.json declares
  `"replace": {"gggeek/ggwebservices": "self.version"}`, so the two names are never installed side by side

* Improved

- README.md uses the new name in every install and upgrade command and explains how to switch:
  `composer remove gggeek/ggwebservices && composer require se7enxweb/ggwebservices`, or change the require line

No code or settings changed.
